:: OC Millers Trouble in Paradise 3 [nobr]

As you enter the cafeteria, you see the line for food is abnormally long and decide to sit down for a minute before getting your food. <span style="color:lightgreen">Instantly, you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> at a table with some other kids and he waves you over.</span> <br>

